- **`public/index.html`** — Game page with `#board` (containing `<canvas>`), overlays (`#paused`, `#game-over`), stats (`#score`, `#length`, `#level`), buttons (`#start-btn`, `#pause-btn`, `#restart-btn`), `#score-form`, and `#leaderboard`.
