- **`public/render.js`** — Canvas rendering, DOM updates (50ms interval + rAF), keyboard/button handlers, leaderboard fetch/submit with no page reload.
- **`public/style.css`** — Macaron pastel theme with all specified colors, rounded corners, Nunito font.

